h2", "a": {"id": "the-27-regions-in-detail"}, "c": ["The 27 regions in detail"]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "locus-01"}, "c": ["Locus 01"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Index variant:"]}, " rs549845 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Position:"]}, " chromosome 1, hg19 44,076,469 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["A1/A2:"]}, " G/A · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Odds ratio for A1:"]}, " 1.082 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["P:"]}, " 9.03e-15 ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Genes within 50 kb in Table 1:"]}, " PTPRF, KDM4A. Previously reported relative to the 2019 ", {"t": "a", "a": {"class": "gloss", "href": "/science/genetics/gen-11/#g-gwas", "title": "A study that scans the whole genome in many people to find common DNA differences linked to a trait"}, "c": ["GWAS"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["The authors highlight PTPRF among candidate postsynaptic-density genes. That is pathway context, not proof that PTPRF rather than another mapped gene mediates this association."]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "locus-02"}, "c": ["Locus 02"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Index variant:"]}, " rs1438898 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Position:"]}, " chromosome 2, hg19 145,714,354 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["A1/A2:"]}, " A/C · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Odds ratio for A1:"]}, " 1.065 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["P:"]}, " 4.88e-9 ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Genes within 50 kb in Table 1:"]}, " None listed. New relative to the 2019 GWAS."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["The table reports a robust regional association. It does not resolve the causal variant, target gene, cell type or individual effect. Functional mapping is a separate evidence step."]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "locus-03"}, "c": ["Locus 03"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Index variant:"]}, " rs2886697 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Position:"]}, " chromosome 3, hg19 20,724,204 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["A1/A2:"]}, " G/A · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Odds ratio for A1:"]}, " 1.061 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["P:"]}, " 7.90e-10 ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Genes within 50 kb in Table 1:"]}, " None listed. Previously reported relative to the 2019 GWAS."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["The table reports a robust regional association. It does not resolve the causal variant, target gene, cell type or individual effect. Functional mapping is a separate evidence step."]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "locus-04"}, "c": ["Locus 04"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Index variant:"]}, " rs9877066 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Position:"]}, " chromosome 3, hg19 43,691,501 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["A1/A2:"]}, " G/A · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Odds ratio for A1:"]}, " 0.888 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["P:"]}, " 6.60e-9 ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Genes within 50 kb in Table 1:"]}, " SNRK, ANO10, ABHD5. New relative to the 2019 GWAS."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["The table reports a robust regional association. It does not resolve the causal variant, target gene, cell type or individual effect. Functional mapping is a separate evidence step."]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "locus-05"}, "c": ["Locus 05"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Index variant:"]}, " rs7613360 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Position:"]}, " chromosome 3, hg19 49,916,710 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["A1/A2:"]}, " C/T · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Odds ratio for A1:"]}, " 0.948 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["P:"]}, " 3.18e-8 ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Genes within 50 kb in Table 1:"]}, " TRAIP, CAMKV, MST1R, CTD-2330K9.3, MON1A. New relative to the 2019 GWAS."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["This chromosome 3 signal sits near several genes, which is precisely why a single nearest-gene explanation would be premature. Compare the authors' fine-mapping and functional mapping before naming a target."]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "locus-06"}, "c": ["Locus 06"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Index variant:"]}, " rs2311059 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Position:"]}, " chromosome 3, hg19 51,884,072 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["A1/A2:"]}, " G/A · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Odds ratio for A1:"]}, " 0.944 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["P:"]}, " 3.16e-8 ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Genes within 50 kb in Table 1:"]}, " IQCF3, IQCF2, IQCF5, IQCF1. New relative to the 2019 GWAS."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["This is a separate chromosome 3 locus close to locus 5 on a chromosome-scale figure. Physical proximity on a plot does not merge the two index-variant records."]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "locus-07"}, "c": ["Locus 07"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Index variant:"]}, " rs17718444 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Position:"]}, " chromosome 3, hg19 71,499,401 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["A1/A2:"]}, " C/T · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Odds ratio for A1:"]}, " 1.063 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["P:"]}, " 2.87e-9 ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Genes within 50 kb in Table 1:"]}, " FOXP1. New relative to the 2019 GWAS."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["FOXP1 is a transcription-factor gene. The paper reports a signal in its transcribed region and credible variants in brain chromatin-interacting regions. Rare FOXP1 disorders are a different type of evidence from this common-variant ADHD association."]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "locus-08"}, "c": ["Locus 08"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Index variant:"]}, " rs114142727 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Position:"]}, " chromosome 3, hg19 87,015,142 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["A1/A2:"]}, " C/G · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Odds ratio for A1:"]}, " 1.285 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["P:"]}, " 5.13e-10 ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Genes within 50 kb in Table 1:"]}, " VGLL3. New relative to the 2019 GWAS."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["The effect allele (C) is the common one here, at a frequency of about 0.99 in both cases and controls; the other allele is rare. Its reported odds ratio is larger than those of most rows. An association estimate is not a clinical ", {"t": "a", "a": {"class": "gloss", "href": "/science/genetics/gen-11/#g-penetrance", "title": "The share of carriers who develop the condition. \"Reduced penetrance\" means some carriers never do"}, "c": ["penetrance"]}, " estimate."]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "locus-09"}, "c": ["Locus 09"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Index variant:"]}, " rs17576773 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Position:"]}, " chromosome 4, hg19 112,217,523 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["A1/A2:"]}, " C/T · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Odds ratio for A1:"]}, " 1.101 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["P:"]}, " 1.63e-10 ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Genes within