": "locus-26"}, "c": ["Locus 26"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Index variant:"]}, " rs7506904 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Position:"]}, " chromosome 18, hg19 50,625,779 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["A1/A2:"]}, " G/A · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Odds ratio for A1:"]}, " 0.946 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["P:"]}, " 1.24e-8 ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Genes within 50 kb in Table 1:"]}, " DCC. New relative to the 2019 GWAS."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["DCC is among the study's postsynaptic-density candidates. This supplies a plausible biological lead, while the index association alone cannot choose among linked variants or mechanisms."]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "locus-27"}, "c": ["Locus 27"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Index variant:"]}, " rs6082363 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Position:"]}, " chromosome 20, hg19 21,250,843 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["A1/A2:"]}, " T/C · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["Odds ratio for A1:"]}, " 1.073 · ", {"t": "strong", "c": ["P:"]}, " 4.38e-12 ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Genes within 50 kb in Table 1:"]}, " XRN2, NKX2-4. New relative to the 2019 GWAS."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["The table reports a robust regional association. It does not resolve the causal variant, target gene, cell type or individual effect. Functional mapping is a separate evidence step."]}, " ", {"t": "h2", "a": {"id": "what-needs-distinguishing", "class": "sec sec-misread"}, "c": ["What needs distinguishing"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["A nearby gene is a location clue, not an identified mechanism. A small odds ratio also does not say whether a person has ADHD or whether they need care. The evidence for assessment and timely support is clinical and functional, alongside the biological evidence; no one needs a genetic result to seek care. See ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/science/genetics/gen-02/"}, "c": ["GEN-02"]}, " and the site’s care and rights pages."]}, " ", {"t": "h2", "a": {"id": "the-deeper-layer-optional-to-read"}, "c": ["The deeper layer (optional to read)"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["A GWAS tests associations across many markers. Linkage disequilibrium means the index variant may tag another causal variant; regulatory effects may reach genes outside the 50 kb column. The paper used additional mapping and functional analyses to prioritise possible genes, but those analyses are a different kind of evidence from Table 1. Its 76 prioritised genes are candidates rather than 76 confirmed causes ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["The row for locus 11 has no gene in the 50 kb table cell, although the authors discuss its relationship to MEF2C downstream. Locus 20 also has nominal rare-variant evidence around SORCS3 from the study's exome data. These details are reasons to examine the paper’s follow-up analysis, not to relabel every row with a single causal gene ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "h2", "a": {"id": "what-this-evidence-can-tell-us", "class": "sec sec-limit"}, "c": ["What this evidence can tell us"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["This is a guide to one historical study’s table, not a current count of all ADHD loci. The study population and analytic choices limit how directly any estimate transfers across ancestries or to an individual. Neither the index variant nor the listed nearby gene is a clinical test or treatment selector. The author correction to the paper fixed a misspelled author name and an omitted acknowledgement, and does not change Table 1; consult the linked correction alongside the study ", {"t": "sup", "a": {"class": "cite"}, "c": ["[", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-1", "aria-label": "Source 1"}, "c": ["1"]}, ", ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "#src-3", "aria-label": "Source 3"}, "c": ["3"]}, "]"]}, "."]}, " ", {"t": "h2", "a": {"id": "sources", "class": "sec sec-src"}, "c": ["Sources"]}, " ", {"t": "ol", "c": [{"t": "li", "a": {"id": "src-1"}, "c": ["Demontis D et al. Genome-wide analyses of ADHD identify 27 risk loci, refine the genetic architecture and implicate several cognitive domains. ", {"t": "em", "c": ["Nature Genetics"]}, " 2023. ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41588-022-01285-8", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["DOI"]}, " · PMID ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36702997/", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["36702997"]}, ". Table 1 and discussion."]}, {"t": "li", "a": {"id": "src-2"}, "c": ["van der Laan CM et al. Genome-wide association meta-analysis of childhood ADHD symptoms and diagnosis identifies new loci and potential effector genes. ", {"t": "em", "c": ["Nature Genetics"]}, " 2025. ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41588-025-02295-y", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["DOI"]}, " · PMID ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40962958/", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["40962958"]}, "."]}, {"t": "li", "a": {"id": "src-3"}, "c": ["Demontis D et al. Author Correction. ", {"t": "em", "c": ["Nature Genetics"]}, " 2023. ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41588-023-01350-w", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["DOI"]}, "."]}]}, " "]}, " ", {"t": "p", "a": {"class": "gloss-hint"}, "c": ["Underlined terms link to the ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/science/genetics/gen-11/"}, "c": ["glossary"]}, "; hover or long-press for a quick definition."]}, " ", {"t": "div", "a": {"class": "nextbox"}, "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Useful next destination."]}, " Return to ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/science/genetics/gen-01/"}, "c": ["GEN-01"]}, " for the overall genetics picture, or ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/science/genetics/gen-02/"}, "c": ["GEN-02"]}, " for a guide to evaluating genetic claims."]}, " ", {"t": "nav", "a": {"class": "gen-series", "aria-label": "Genetics series"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/science/genetics/"}, "c": ["All genetics articles"]}, {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/science/genetics/gen-11/"}, "c": ["Glossary"]}, {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/sources/numbers/"}, "c": ["Verified numbers"]}]}, " "]}}